cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite both the paper and this repository."
title: "Camera-Based Three-Axis Attitude Measurement for Small-Satellite Testbeds: A V&V Approach"
abstract: >-
  Acquisition code, raw campaign data and reproduction pipeline supporting IEEE Aerospace
  Conference paper 2389. An overhead camera used as a small-satellite testbed attitude
  reference is treated as the subsystem under test and validated against a pulse-derived
  commanded reference and independent inertial references, with explicit clock alignment
  and planar-pose conditioning diagnostics.
